# [MPLS](../wg/mpls.html)

## Summary

The MPLS Working Group met to discuss working group status, updates on active documents, and several technical presentations covering STAMP session bootstrapping via LSP ping, signaling RSVP-TE tunnels over an SR-MPLS forwarding plane using adjacency segment identifiers (SIDs), and supporting Explicit Congestion Notification (ECN) in MPLS using MPLS Network Actions (MNA). 

Key developments include an upcoming Working Group Last Call for `draft-ietf-mpls-stamp`, plans for an interim meeting to address signaling RSVP-TE over SR-MPLS, and upcoming adoption requests for new MNA extensions.

